  "description": "Stellaegis Issuer: the OpenID Connect issuer of an application assembled on Stellaegis.Primitives. It takes a user the host has authenticated and turns them into tokens — authorization code with PKCE, client credentials, refresh —, holds the clients and the scopes, revokes, and tells every resource server whether a token is revoked. Built on OpenIddict; it issues tokens and knows no account.",
